#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5573
msgid "Keep earlier versions"
msgstr "पिछले संस्करण रखें"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5574
msgid "Every hour, for two months. Only what changed takes room."
msgstr "हर घंटे, दो महीने तक। जगह सिर्फ़ बदली हुई चीज़ें लेती हैं।"

