msgstr "हाल की फ़ाइलें भूल जाएं"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5784
msgid "The list of what you opened is cleared. Your files stay. Sure?"
msgstr "आपकी खोली गई चीज़ों की सूची मिट जाएगी। आपकी फ़ाइलें बनी रहेंगी। पक्का?"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5785
msgid "Cleared. Your files are still there."
msgstr "मिटा दिया। आपकी फ़ाइलें अब भी वहीं हैं।"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5786
msgid "Clears the list, not the files"
msgstr "सूची मिटती है, फ़ाइलें नहीं"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5797
msgid "Forget…"
msgstr "भूल जाएं…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:5814
